# New Employee Onboarding Checklist

## Pre-Start (1 Week Before)
- [ ] Send welcome email with start date and logistics
- [ ] Order laptop and equipment
- [ ] Create email account and system access
- [ ] Assign onboarding buddy
- [ ] Schedule first-week meetings

## Day 1
- [ ] Welcome meeting with manager
- [ ] IT setup and system access
- [ ] Office tour (if in-office)
- [ ] Complete HR paperwork
- [ ] Lunch with team

## Week 1
- [ ] Complete compliance training
- [ ] Review employee handbook
- [ ] Meet with key team members
- [ ] Set up development environment (for engineers)
- [ ] Review role expectations and goals

## Month 1
- [ ] 30-day check-in with manager
- [ ] Complete product training
- [ ] Shadow team members
- [ ] Begin working on first project

